Package: clgam
Type: Package
Title: Composite Link Generalized Additive (Mixed) Models
Version: 0.1.9
Authors@R: c(
    person("Diego", "Ayma Anza", role = "aut",
           email = "dayma@est-econ.uc3m.es"),
    person("Dae-Jin", "Lee", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dae-jin.lee@ie.edu"),
    person("Maria", "Durban", role = "ctb"),
    person("Paul H. C.", "Eilers", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Fits composite link generalized additive (mixed) models (CL-GAM /
    CL-GAMM) for areal count data with P-splines and separation of overlapping
    precision matrices (SOP) estimation. Supports area-to-area disaggregation
    with a composition matrix C and multi-resolution covariates (Cases A--C).
    Includes RcppArmadillo kernels for the SOP hot path and helpers to
    simulate synthetic ATA data for examples and tests. No proprietary health
    microdata are shipped with the package.
